  "description": "Immerse yourself in the dramatic flair of the 1950s with our set of 18 digital papers featuring a vintage pop-art woman crying. \nInspired by classic comic book art, these 3600 x 3600 pixels (12”x12”) PNG images at 300 DPI offer high-quality, vivid visuals perfect for a range of creative projects.\nThese versatile digital papers are ideal for:\n* Cards: Craft unique and expressive greeting cards that stand out with a retro touch.\n* Scrapbooks: Add a nostalgic and emotional layer to your scrapbook pages.\n* Junk Journals: Enhance your junk journals with vintage comic book charm and expressive imagery.\n* Wall Art: Create striking wall art prints that evoke the dramatic essence of 1950s pop art.\n* Planners: Incorporate these designs into planners for a unique and stylish look.\n* and more.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the dramatic flair of the 1950s with our set of 18 digital papers featuring a vintage pop-art woman crying. </p>\n<p>Inspired by classic comic book art, these 3600 x 3600 pixels (12”x12”) PNG images at 300 DPI offer high-quality, vivid visuals perfect for a range of creative projects.</p>\n<p>These versatile digital papers are ideal for:</p>\n<p>* Cards: Craft unique and expressive greeting cards that stand out with a retro touch.<br>\n* Scrapbooks: Add a nostalgic and emotional layer to your scrapbook pages.<br>\n* Junk Journals: Enhance your junk journals with vintage comic book charm and expressive imagery.<br>\n* Wall Art: Create striking wall art prints that evoke the dramatic essence of 1950s pop art.<br>\n* Planners: Incorporate these designs into planners for a unique and stylish look.<br>\n* and more.</p>",
